{"id":55,"name":"الرحمن","transliteration":"Ar-Rahman","translation_fr":"Le Tout Miséricordieux","translation_en":"The Beneficent","type":"medinan","total_verses":78,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنُ","translation_fr":"Le Tout Miséricordieux","translation_en":"The Most Merciful","transliteration":"Alrrahmanu"},{"id":2,"text":"عَلَّمَ ٱلۡقُرۡءَانَ","translation_fr":"Il a enseigné le Coran","translation_en":"Taught the Qur'an","transliteration":"AAallama alqurana"},{"id":3,"text":"خَلَقَ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ","translation_fr":"Il a créé l'homme","translation_en":"Created man","transliteration":"Khalaqa alinsana"},{"id":4,"text":"عَلَّمَهُ ٱلۡبَيَانَ","translation_fr":"Il lui a appris à s'exprimer clairement","translation_en":"[And] taught him eloquence","transliteration":"AAallamahu albayana"},{"id":5,"text":"ٱلشَّمۡسُ وَٱلۡقَمَرُ بِحُسۡبَانٖ","translation_fr":"Le soleil et la lune [évoluent] selon un calcul [minutieux]","translation_en":"The sun and the moon [move] by precise calculation","transliteration":"Alshshamsu waalqamaru bihusbanin"},{"id":6,"text":"وَٱلنَّجۡمُ وَٱلشَّجَرُ يَسۡجُدَانِ","translation_fr":"Et l'herbe et les arbres se prosternent","translation_en":"And the stars and trees prostrate","transliteration":"Waalnnajmu waalshshajaru yasjudani"},{"id":7,"text":"وَٱلسَّمَآءَ رَفَعَهَا وَوَضَعَ ٱلۡمِيزَانَ","translation_fr":"Et quant au ciel, Il l'a élevé bien haut. Et Il a établi la balance","translation_en":"And the heaven He raised and imposed the balance","transliteration":"Waalssamaa rafaAAaha wawadaAAa almeezana"},{"id":8,"text":"أَلَّا تَطۡغَوۡاْ فِي ٱلۡمِيزَانِ","translation_fr":"afin que vous ne transgressiez pas dans la pesée","translation_en":"That you not transgress within the balance","transliteration":"Alla tatghaw fee almeezani"},{"id":9,"text":"وَأَقِيمُواْ ٱلۡوَزۡنَ بِٱلۡقِسۡطِ وَلَا تُخۡسِرُواْ ٱلۡمِيزَانَ","translation_fr":"Donnez [toujours] le poids exact et ne faussez pas la pesée","translation_en":"And establish weight in justice and do not make deficient the balance","transliteration":"Waaqeemoo alwazna bialqisti wala tukhsiroo almeezana"},{"id":10,"text":"وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ وَضَعَهَا لِلۡأَنَامِ","translation_fr":"Quant à la terre, Il l'a étendue pour les êtres vivants","translation_en":"And the earth He laid [out] for the creatures","transliteration":"Waalarda wadaAAaha lilanami"},{"id":11,"text":"فِيهَا فَٰكِهَةٞ وَٱلنَّخۡلُ ذَاتُ ٱلۡأَكۡمَامِ","translation_fr":"il s'y trouve des fruits, et aussi les palmiers aux fruits recouverts d'enveloppes","translation_en":"Therein is fruit and palm trees having sheaths [of dates]","transliteration":"Feeha fakihatun waalnnakhlu thatu alakmami"},{"id":12,"text":"وَٱلۡحَبُّ ذُو ٱلۡعَصۡفِ وَٱلرَّيۡحَانُ","translation_fr":"tout comme les grains dans leurs balles, et les plantes aromatiques","translation_en":"And grain having husks and scented plants","transliteration":"Waalhabbu thoo alAAasfi waalrrayhani"},{"id":13,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":14,"text":"خَلَقَ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ مِن صَلۡصَٰلٖ كَٱلۡفَخَّارِ","translation_fr":"Il a crée l'homme d'argile sonnante comme la poterie","translation_en":"He created man from clay like [that of] pottery","transliteration":"Khalaqa alinsana min salsalin kaalfakhkhari"},{"id":15,"text":"وَخَلَقَ ٱلۡجَآنَّ مِن مَّارِجٖ مِّن نَّارٖ","translation_fr":"et Il a créé les djinns de la flamme d'un feu sans fumée","translation_en":"And He created the jinn from a smokeless flame of fire","transliteration":"Wakhalaqa aljanna min marijin min narin"},{"id":16,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":17,"text":"رَبُّ ٱلۡمَشۡرِقَيۡنِ وَرَبُّ ٱلۡمَغۡرِبَيۡنِ","translation_fr":"Seigneur des deux Levants et Seigneur des deux Couchants","translation_en":"[He is] Lord of the two sunrises and Lord of the two sunsets","transliteration":"Rabbu almashriqayni warabbu almaghribayni"},{"id":18,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":19,"text":"مَرَجَ ٱلۡبَحۡرَيۡنِ يَلۡتَقِيَانِ","translation_fr":"Il a donné libre cours aux deux mers pour se rencontrer","translation_en":"He released the two seas, meeting [side by side]","transliteration":"Maraja albahrayni yaltaqiyani"},{"id":20,"text":"بَيۡنَهُمَا بَرۡزَخٞ لَّا يَبۡغِيَانِ","translation_fr":"il y a entre elles une barrière qu'elles ne dépassent pas","translation_en":"Between them is a barrier [so] neither of them transgresses","transliteration":"Baynahuma barzakhun la yabghiyani"},{"id":21,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":22,"text":"يَخۡرُجُ مِنۡهُمَا ٱللُّؤۡلُؤُ وَٱلۡمَرۡجَانُ","translation_fr":"De ces deux [mers] sortent la perle et le corail","translation_en":"From both of them emerge pearl and coral","transliteration":"Yakhruju minhuma alluluo waalmarjanu"},{"id":23,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":24,"text":"وَلَهُ ٱلۡجَوَارِ ٱلۡمُنشَـَٔاتُ فِي ٱلۡبَحۡرِ كَٱلۡأَعۡلَٰمِ","translation_fr":"A Lui appartiennent les vaisseaux élevés sur la mer comme des montagnes","translation_en":"And to Him belong the ships [with sails] elevated in the sea like mountains","transliteration":"Walahu aljawari almunshaatu fee albahri kaalaAAlami"},{"id":25,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":26,"text":"كُلُّ مَنۡ عَلَيۡهَا فَانٖ","translation_fr":"Tout ce qui est sur elle [la terre] doit disparaître","translation_en":"Everyone upon the earth will perish","transliteration":"Kullu man AAalayha fanin"},{"id":27,"text":"وَيَبۡقَىٰ وَجۡهُ رَبِّكَ ذُو ٱلۡجَلَٰلِ وَٱلۡإِكۡرَامِ","translation_fr":"[Seule] subsistera La Face [Wajh] de ton Seigneur, plein de majesté et de noblesse","translation_en":"And there will remain the Face of your Lord, Owner of Majesty and Honor","transliteration":"Wayabqa wajhu rabbika thoo aljalali waalikrami"},{"id":28,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":29,"text":"يَسۡـَٔلُهُۥ مَن فِي ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضِۚ كُلَّ يَوۡمٍ هُوَ فِي شَأۡنٖ","translation_fr":"Ceux qui sont dans les cieux et la terre L'implorent. Chaque jour, Il accomplit une œuvre nouvelle","translation_en":"Whoever is within the heavens and earth asks Him; every day He is bringing about a matter","transliteration":"Yasaluhu man fee alssamawati waalardi kulla yawmin huwa fee shanin"},{"id":30,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":31,"text":"سَنَفۡرُغُ لَكُمۡ أَيُّهَ ٱلثَّقَلَانِ","translation_fr":"Nous allons bientôt entreprendre votre jugement, ô vous les deux charges [hommes et djinns]","translation_en":"We will attend to you, O prominent beings","transliteration":"Sanafrughu lakum ayyuha alththaqalani"},{"id":32,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":33,"text":"يَٰمَعۡشَرَ ٱلۡجِنِّ وَٱلۡإِنسِ إِنِ ٱسۡتَطَعۡتُمۡ أَن تَنفُذُواْ مِنۡ أَقۡطَارِ ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضِ فَٱنفُذُواْۚ لَا تَنفُذُونَ إِلَّا بِسُلۡطَٰنٖ","translation_fr":"O peuple de djinns et d'hommes! Si vous pouvez sortir du domaine des cieux et de la terre, alors faites-le. Mais vous ne pourrez en sortir qu'à l'aide d'un pouvoir [illimité]","translation_en":"O company of jinn and mankind, if you are able to pass beyond the regions of the heavens and the earth, then pass. You will not pass except by authority [from Allah]","transliteration":"Ya maAAshara aljinni waalinsi ini istataAAtum an tanfuthoo min aqtari alssamawati waalardi faonfuthoo la tanfuthoona illa bisultanin"},{"id":34,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":35,"text":"يُرۡسَلُ عَلَيۡكُمَا شُوَاظٞ مِّن نَّارٖ وَنُحَاسٞ فَلَا تَنتَصِرَانِ","translation_fr":"Il sera lancé contre vous un jet de feu et de fumée [ou de cuivre fondu], et vous ne serez pas secourus","translation_en":"There will be sent upon you a flame of fire and smoke, and you will not defend yourselves","transliteration":"Yursalu AAalaykuma shuwathun min narin wanuhasun fala tantasirani"},{"id":36,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":37,"text":"فَإِذَا ٱنشَقَّتِ ٱلسَّمَآءُ فَكَانَتۡ وَرۡدَةٗ كَٱلدِّهَانِ","translation_fr":"Puis quand le ciel se fendra et deviendra alors écarlate comme le cuir rouge","translation_en":"And when the heaven is split open and becomes rose-colored like oil","transliteration":"Faitha inshaqqati alssamao fakanat wardatan kaalddihani"},{"id":38,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":39,"text":"فَيَوۡمَئِذٖ لَّا يُسۡـَٔلُ عَن ذَنۢبِهِۦٓ إِنسٞ وَلَا جَآنّٞ","translation_fr":"Alors, ni aux hommes ni aux djinns, on ne posera des questions à propos de leurs péchés","translation_en":"Then on that Day none will be asked about his sin among men or jinn","transliteration":"Fayawmaithin la yusalu AAan thanbihi insun wala jannun"},{"id":40,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":41,"text":"يُعۡرَفُ ٱلۡمُجۡرِمُونَ بِسِيمَٰهُمۡ فَيُؤۡخَذُ بِٱلنَّوَٰصِي وَٱلۡأَقۡدَامِ","translation_fr":"On reconnaîtra les criminels à leurs traits. Ils seront donc saisis par les toupets et les pieds","translation_en":"The criminals will be known by their marks, and they will be seized by the forelocks and the feet","transliteration":"YuAArafu almujrimoona biseemahum fayukhathu bialnnawasee waalaqdami"},{"id":42,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":43,"text":"هَٰذِهِۦ جَهَنَّمُ ٱلَّتِي يُكَذِّبُ بِهَا ٱلۡمُجۡرِمُونَ","translation_fr":"Voilà l'Enfer que les criminels traitaient de mensonge","translation_en":"This is Hell, which the criminals deny","transliteration":"Hathihi jahannamu allatee yukaththibu biha almujrimoona"},{"id":44,"text":"يَطُوفُونَ بَيۡنَهَا وَبَيۡنَ حَمِيمٍ ءَانٖ","translation_fr":"Ils feront le va-et-vient entre lui (l'Enfer) et une eau bouillante extrêmement chaude","translation_en":"They will go around between it and scalding water, heated [to the utmost degree]","transliteration":"Yatoofoona baynaha wabayna hameemin anin"},{"id":45,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":46,"text":"وَلِمَنۡ خَافَ مَقَامَ رَبِّهِۦ جَنَّتَانِ","translation_fr":"Et pour celui qui aura craint de comparaître devant son Seigneur, il y aura deux jardins","translation_en":"But for he who has feared the position of his Lord are two gardens","transliteration":"Waliman khafa maqama rabbihi jannatani"},{"id":47,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":48,"text":"ذَوَاتَآ أَفۡنَانٖ","translation_fr":"Aux branches touffues","translation_en":"Having [spreading] branches","transliteration":"Thawata afnanin"},{"id":49,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":50,"text":"فِيهِمَا عَيۡنَانِ تَجۡرِيَانِ","translation_fr":"Ils y trouveront deux sources courantes","translation_en":"In both of them are two springs, flowing","transliteration":"Feehima AAaynani tajriyani"},{"id":51,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":52,"text":"فِيهِمَا مِن كُلِّ فَٰكِهَةٖ زَوۡجَانِ","translation_fr":"Ils contiennent deux espèces de chaque fruit","translation_en":"In both of them are of every fruit, two kinds","transliteration":"Feehima min kulli fakihatin zawjani"},{"id":53,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":54,"text":"مُتَّكِـِٔينَ عَلَىٰ فُرُشِۭ بَطَآئِنُهَا مِنۡ إِسۡتَبۡرَقٖۚ وَجَنَى ٱلۡجَنَّتَيۡنِ دَانٖ","translation_fr":"Ils seront accoudés sur des tapis doublés de brocart, et les fruits des deux jardins seront à leur portée (pour être cueillis)","translation_en":"[They are] reclining on beds whose linings are of silk brocade, and the fruit of the two gardens is hanging low","transliteration":"Muttakieena AAala furushin batainuha min istabraqin wajana aljannatayni danin"},{"id":55,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":56,"text":"فِيهِنَّ قَٰصِرَٰتُ ٱلطَّرۡفِ لَمۡ يَطۡمِثۡهُنَّ إِنسٞ قَبۡلَهُمۡ وَلَا جَآنّٞ","translation_fr":"Ils y trouveront [les houris] aux regards chastes, qu'avant eux aucun homme ou djinn n'aura déflorées","translation_en":"In them are women limiting [their] glances, untouched before them by man or jinni","transliteration":"Feehinna qasiratu alttarfi lam yatmithhunna insun qablahum wala jannun"},{"id":57,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":58,"text":"كَأَنَّهُنَّ ٱلۡيَاقُوتُ وَٱلۡمَرۡجَانُ","translation_fr":"Elles seront [aussi belles] que le rubis et le corail","translation_en":"As if they were rubies and coral","transliteration":"Kaannahunna alyaqootu waalmarjanu"},{"id":59,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":60,"text":"هَلۡ جَزَآءُ ٱلۡإِحۡسَٰنِ إِلَّا ٱلۡإِحۡسَٰنُ","translation_fr":"Y a-t-il d'autre récompense pour le bien, que le bien","translation_en":"Is the reward for good [anything] but good","transliteration":"Hal jazao alihsani illa alihsanu"},{"id":61,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":62,"text":"وَمِن دُونِهِمَا جَنَّتَانِ","translation_fr":"En deçà de ces deux jardins il y aura deux autres jardins","translation_en":"And below them both [in excellence] are two [other] gardens","transliteration":"Wamin doonihima jannatani"},{"id":63,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":64,"text":"مُدۡهَآمَّتَانِ","translation_fr":"Ils sont d'un vert sombre","translation_en":"Dark green [in color]","transliteration":"Mudhammatani"},{"id":65,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":66,"text":"فِيهِمَا عَيۡنَانِ نَضَّاخَتَانِ","translation_fr":"Dans lesquelles il y aura deux sources jaillissantes","translation_en":"In both of them are two springs, spouting","transliteration":"Feehima AAaynani naddakhatani"},{"id":67,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":68,"text":"فِيهِمَا فَٰكِهَةٞ وَنَخۡلٞ وَرُمَّانٞ","translation_fr":"Ils contiennent des fruits, des palmiers, et des grenadiers","translation_en":"In both of them are fruit and palm trees and pomegranates","transliteration":"Feehima fakihatun wanakhlun warummanun"},{"id":69,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":70,"text":"فِيهِنَّ خَيۡرَٰتٌ حِسَانٞ","translation_fr":"Là, il y aura des vertueuses et des belles","translation_en":"In them are good and beautiful women","transliteration":"Feehinna khayratun hisanun"},{"id":71,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":72,"text":"حُورٞ مَّقۡصُورَٰتٞ فِي ٱلۡخِيَامِ","translation_fr":"Des houris cloîtrées dans les tentes","translation_en":"Fair ones reserved in pavilions","transliteration":"Hoorun maqsooratun fee alkhiyami"},{"id":73,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":74,"text":"لَمۡ يَطۡمِثۡهُنَّ إِنسٞ قَبۡلَهُمۡ وَلَا جَآنّٞ","translation_fr":"qu'avant eux aucun homme ou djinn n'a déflorées","translation_en":"Untouched before them by man or jinni","transliteration":"Lam yatmithhunna insun qablahum wala jannun"},{"id":75,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":76,"text":"مُتَّكِـِٔينَ عَلَىٰ رَفۡرَفٍ خُضۡرٖ وَعَبۡقَرِيٍّ حِسَانٖ","translation_fr":"Ils seront accoudés sur des coussins verts et des tapis épais et jolis","translation_en":"Reclining on green cushions and beautiful fine carpets","transliteration":"Muttakieena AAala rafrafin khudrin waAAabqariyyin hisanin"},{"id":77,"text":"فَبِأَيِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكُمَا تُكَذِّبَانِ","translation_fr":"Lequel donc des bienfaits de votre Seigneur nierez-vous","translation_en":"So which of the favors of your Lord would you deny","transliteration":"Fabiayyi alai rabbikuma tukaththibani"},{"id":78,"text":"تَبَٰرَكَ ٱسۡمُ رَبِّكَ ذِي ٱلۡجَلَٰلِ وَٱلۡإِكۡرَامِ","translation_fr":"Béni soit le Nom de ton Seigneur, Plein de Majesté et de Munificence","translation_en":"Blessed is the name of your Lord, Owner of Majesty and Honor","transliteration":"Tabaraka ismu rabbika thee aljalali waalikrami"}]}